# 仮身一覧 given a record that is a text (design 11.3), for tools/ui_run.py. The desktop's
# own window shows a text with the text editor whichever program opened it; 仮身一覧 as a
# process opens nothing but a figure, so the desktop gives a text to the program of texts
# instead. A copy of 基本文章編集 (mkbig doc 5) whose applist says 仮身一覧 (apps) is opened
# by the desktop's cabinet (cabproc kernel), and then with 仮身一覧 and 基本文章編集 both as
# processes (cabproc 1, docproc 1): the text editor's process opens it, not 仮身一覧's, which
# would say it cannot open it. The shots (cabdoc_k, cabdoc_p) are compared afterwards inside
# the window, where the text is.
cabproc kernel
mkbig doc 5
apps big virtual-object-list
open big
waitwin 基本文章編集 600
sync 600
wait 500
move 690 490
sync 600
wait 500
shot cabdoc_k
key 08 01
sync 600
wait 500
cabproc 1
docproc 1
logmark
open big
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 5
wait 800
move 690 490
wait 500
shot cabdoc_p
key 08 01
expect document: closed
absent cabinet: the object cannot be read
docproc 0
cabproc 0
